1.Create a directory /mnt/devops_data.
Mount a new volume (or loop device for local practice).
Verify using df -h and mount | grep devops_data.
sol:
sudo mkdir -p /mnt/devops_data
sudo dd if=/dev/zero of=/tmp/devops_disk.img bs=1M count=100
sudo mkfs.ext4 /tmp/devops_disk.img
sudo mount -o loop /tmp/devops_disk.img /mnt/devops_data
df -h
mount | grep devops_data
